Source: kosmos-astrophotography
Section: metapackages
Priority: Optional
Maintainer: Matteo Piscitelli <matteo@matteopiscitelli.it>
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)

Package: kosmos-astrophotography
Architecture: all
Recommends: kstars, phd2
Suggests: gsc
Description: Astrophotography software suite.
 This metapackage installs all astrophotography related packages:
  * INDI bins and library
  * KStars
  * PHD2
 NOTE that this package doesn't install any of INDI "3rdparty" drivers.
 In case you need one of them, please install relevant package. You can search
 in the repository with:
 .
   > apt list indi-<something>*
 .
 or
 .
   > apt search <something>
 .
 Alternatively, you can install all 3rdparty INDI drivers installing the
 metapackage "indi-3rdparty-all".
 .
 If you need PHD Log Viewer, you can install it with:
 .
   > sudo apt install phdlogview

